# App routes live on meet.dicta.uz after the split. These 301s forward old
# dicta.uz links for WEB browsers. Mobile Universal Links intercept before HTTP
# (see /.well-known/apple-app-site-association), so app installs open natively.
#
# NOTE: root-level share codes (^[a-z]{3}-[a-z]{4}-[a-z]{3}$, e.g. dicta.uz/abc-defg-hij)
# CANNOT be matched here (no regex in _redirects). Add a Cloudflare Worker on
# dicta.uz/* for those — see docs/cloudflare-migration.md. Marketing pages
# (/, /pricing anchor, /privacy, /terms, /download, /ru/*, /en/*, /.well-known/*)
# are real files and are served without a rule.

/m/*                  https://meet.dicta.uz/m/:splat                  301
/recap/*              https://meet.dicta.uz/recap/:splat              301
/join/*               https://meet.dicta.uz/join/:splat               301
/invite/*             https://meet.dicta.uz/invite/:splat             301
/dm/*                 https://meet.dicta.uz/dm/:splat                 301
/room/*               https://meet.dicta.uz/room/:splat               301
/dashboard/*          https://meet.dicta.uz/dashboard/:splat          301
/settings/*           https://meet.dicta.uz/settings/:splat           301
/account/*            https://meet.dicta.uz/account/:splat            301
/billing/*            https://meet.dicta.uz/billing/:splat            301
/support/*            https://meet.dicta.uz/support/:splat            301
/impersonate/*        https://meet.dicta.uz/impersonate/:splat        301
# Exact (no trailing slash) — the desktop app opens /desktop-auth?state=..&challenge=..
# which the /desktop-auth/* glob does NOT match, so it must be listed explicitly
# (same as /sign-in below). Without this the app's auth bounce hits the marketing SPA.
/desktop-auth         https://meet.dicta.uz/desktop-auth              301
/desktop-auth/*       https://meet.dicta.uz/desktop-auth/:splat       301
/connect-telegram/*   https://meet.dicta.uz/connect-telegram/:splat   301
/sign-in              https://meet.dicta.uz/sign-in                   301
/sign-up              https://meet.dicta.uz/sign-up                   301
